      <description><p>Today I catagorigised my music with <a href="http://last.fm/">Last.fm</a>‘s <a href="http://blog.last.fm/2009/03/11/introducing-boffin-lastfms-music-knowledge-meets-your-mp3-collection">Boffin</a>, and then took the resulting list of genres with their respective frequencies and plugged it into <a href="http://www.wordle.net/">Wordle</a>.</p>
<p><a href="http://www.wordle.net/gallery/wrdl/687741/Metal"><figure><img src="/post/2009/03/25/last-fm-s-boffin-wordle/metal.png"><figcaption>
